    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i'm waiting for a storm... it feels like the storm is already over and there's just nothing left. the fog is gone and all that's left is this empty space. it's so quiet here at the edge. it's almost peaceful, in a way. like the only way to actually finish the story is to just... step into the quiet. it feels more right than trying to turn back and walk through the dark again.",
